.ts errors. Let me double-check there's no `ui/` inclusion issue... Actually tsgo:core includes ui config? The errors were in ui/vitest.config.ts. That's pre-existing in base too. Fine.\n\nLet me also run the eslint (root) scoped lint on the touched files as another lint path? The AGENTS.md says `pnpm run lint` (ESLint). oxlint already passed. Let me try root eslint on the new files if eslint is available.\n\nLet me quickly run eslint on the two source files from the root workspace.\n\nActually the acceptance record says scoped lint = oxlint on the 3 files, exit 0. I verified that. Good enough, but let me also try root eslint since it's cheap, using the junctioned node_modules.\n\nLet me finalize. First, one more verification: run the full oracle command one final time from the final workspace copy state (rsi-verify-s06-a1 has the final files already — I copied them before running; digest check confirmed). Actually I copied files at the start into a1; then later confirmed digests match. And tests passed. \n\nBut note: after copying into a1, I also added the 2 guard tests to a1. So a1 = agent + guards. The oracle command passed 24 tests. \n\nLet me now also verify agent tree still has correct digests (unchanged since).\n\nThen produce the final structured result.\n\nLet me do a final digest re-verify of the workspace and confirm no accidental edits."}}
